{"content":[{"c":["HAMATH*, Entrance of"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Place of uncertain identification, marking the northern border of the Canaanite territory promised to Israel by God (",{"href":"?bref=Num.34.8","r":"Num.34.8","rawR":"Num.34.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.34.8","value":"Num.34.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 34:8"},"), but only attained by the time of the monarchy (",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.8.65","r":"1Kgs.8.65","rawR":"1Kgs.8.65","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.8.65","value":"1Kgs.8.65"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kgs 8:65"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.13.5","r":"1Chr.13.5","rawR":"1Chr.13.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.13.5","value":"1Chr.13.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 13:5"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.7.8","r":"2Chr.7.8","rawR":"2Chr.7.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.7.8","value":"2Chr.7.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 7:8"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["After the death of Solomon, the kingdom was divided and the northern boundary shrank. It was not until the reign of Jeroboam II, son of Joash (793–753 ",{"c":["BC"],"sourceClass":"era","t":"span"},"), king of the northern kingdom (called Israel), that the northern boundaries extended again to the entrance of Hamath (",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.14.23-25","r":"2Kgs.14.23-25","rawR":"2Kgs.14.23-25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.14.23-25","value":"2Kgs.14.23-25"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kgs 14:23-25"},")."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"},{"c":["Both Amos and Ezekiel refer to the entrance of Hamath in their prophecies concerning Israel (",{"href":"?bref=Amos.6.14","r":"Amos.6.14","rawR":"Amos.6.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Amos.6.14","value":"Amos.6.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Am 6:14"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ezek.47.15-20","r":"Ezek.47.15-20","rawR":"Ezek.47.15-20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezek.47.15-20","value":"Ezek.47.15-20"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ez 47:15-20"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ezek.48.1","r":"Ezek.48.1","rawR":"Ezek.48.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezek.48.1","value":"Ezek.48.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"48:1"},"). Some authorities regard the place as the ancient town Lebo-hamath, identified with modern Lebweh. ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Hamath_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Hamath_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Hamath_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Hamath #1"},"; ",{"href":"?item=LeboHamath_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"LeboHamath_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"LeboHamath_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Lebo-hamath"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"HamathEntranceof","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Nm 34:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.34.8","rawQueryValue":"Num.34.8","sourceRefExact":"Num.34.8"},{"anchorText":"1 Kgs 8:65","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Kgs.8.65","rawQueryValue":"1Kgs.8.65","sourceRefExact":"1Kgs.8.65"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 13:5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.13.5","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.13.5","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.13.5"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 7:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.7.8","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.7.8","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.7.8"},{"anchorText":"2 Kgs 14:23-25","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Kgs.14.23-25","rawQueryValue":"2Kgs.14.23-25","sourceRefExact":"2Kgs.14.23-25"},{"anchorText":"Am 6:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Amos.6.14","rawQueryValue":"Amos.6.14","sourceRefExact":"Amos.6.14"},{"anchorText":"Ez 47:15-20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezek.47.15-20","rawQueryValue":"Ezek.47.15-20","sourceRefExact":"Ezek.47.15-20"},{"anchorText":"48:1",